description: Do not re-ignore bot script folders; only secrets and runtime logs stay out of git
globs: .gitignore,.cursorignore,.cursorindexingignore
alwaysApply: false
---

# Bot gitignore

Scripts, `bots/quests/`, `bots/roster.json`, and lab notes are tracked. Do not restore `bots/*/` — that hid 48k lines of route logic and made copies undiffable.

Ignore only:

```
bots/**/bot.env
!bots/_template/bot.env
bots/**/*.env
bots/**/*.log
bots/**/*.pid
bots/**/assignment.json
```

`.cursorignore` may keep `bot.env` out of AI context. It must not hide `bots/**/*.ts`. `.cursorindexingignore` may skip `*.log` only.
